# Session state is local only. It is a handover scratch file, never a
# deliverable, and it must never be committed or pushed.
SESSION-STATE.md

# Working documents are local only. They describe how the work is done,
# not what the project is.
AGENTS.md

# Generated by the build. The JDK API table is written by the generator
# from the build JDK's own ct.sym, and the generator replaces whatever
# was there, so tracking it would leave the tree dirty after every
# native build and could delete the file a build needs.
importtruth-core/src/main/resources/jdk-api/
